{"id":"vod_sn_36357","vodId":"36357","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"吊带袜天使","name_cn":"吊带袜天使","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1274dbeb191e246baa6d04c6ca2b2f05.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一座名为堕天城的城市之中，它夹在天堂和地狱之间，是一座充满了危险和奇遇的城市。近日来，城市里出现了邪恶的恶灵，他们依靠袭击市民们为生，这令市民们人心惶惶人人自危。　　Panty（小笠原亚里沙 配音）和Stocking（伊濑茉莉也 配音）本是两位天使，却因为他们桀骜不驯的作风而被逐出了天堂，来到了堕天城。在这里，姐妹两人遇见了名为Garterbelt（石井康嗣 配音）的神父，在这位拥有着神秘过去的神父的带领下，Panty和Stocking成为了恶灵狩猎者，通过狩猎恶灵得到天堂金币，当天堂金币积攒到了一定的数量之时，Panty和Stocking便可以借此重新返回天堂。就这样，两人在堕天城的日常就此拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uvsFvPU4jv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MHFfcxZS5e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y65AqcE0Xf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/np7inK1Acv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sVMUMRkPR81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8PhsqsPKj21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VF228hpbAK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SpQJkMzyfN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bYGYVZ6TBD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c4DrwM0YXR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bre1FMFf7s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FjSjDwHPBs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8kUrgQHa3x1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:23.537Z"}